WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.640
never transferred to its respective doomed flight, which, when searched, just so happened

00:05.640 --> 00:11.600
to contain written-app breakdowns of all 19 hijackers, their backgrounds, their motives,

00:11.600 --> 00:16.880
each of their assignments, their ties to al-Qaeda, a video cassette of a Boeing flight simulator,

00:16.880 --> 00:19.120
a knife and pepper spray.

00:19.120 --> 00:25.840
The entire plot of 9-11 neatly packaged and dropped in their lap of all the passengers

00:25.840 --> 00:32.720
and all the planes, the one suitcase that just so happened to not make the plane has

00:32.720 --> 00:36.640
a written-app breakdown of the attacks.

00:36.640 --> 00:44.240
I call this one the magic suitcase, which when coupled with the magic passports, you get

00:44.240 --> 00:51.040
the FBI's official reasoning when asked how on earth they were instantly able to discern

00:51.040 --> 00:55.200
all of the hijackers and how they were attached to al-Qaeda.

00:55.200 --> 00:57.200
That is some stroke of luck.

